      "side": 1,
      "message": "You need more than just setting restat.  The current rule always writes to `$out` so ninja will always see an updated timestamp and consider the output modified.  For jar outputs you can add `-write_if_changed` to the soong_zip command.  In this case the soong_zip command may be run in RBE, so you also have to get rewrapper to not rewrite the files, which seems to be supported by `--preserve_unchanged_output_mtime` according to b/192886711.",
