      "side": 1,
      "message": "For this pass, I went with the more traditional approach of \"rebuild it in a tmp file, and copy to $out if it changed\".  That means we rebuild the current jar (and see that it is unchanged), but don\u0027t rebuild anything depending on it, rather than having the tool decide that it didn\u0027t change during creation.",
